\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hail, Thou once despised Jesus!
\par Hail, Thou Galilean King!
\par Thou didst free salvation bring,
\par Hail,Thou agonizing Saviour,
\par Bearer of our sin and shame!
\par By Thy merits we find favour;
\par Life is given through Thy name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Paschal Lamb by God appointed,
\par All our sins on Thee were laid;
\par By almighty love anointed,
\par Thou hast full atonement made:
\par All Thy people are forgiven
\par Through the virtue of Thy blood;
\par Opened is the gate of heaven;
\par Peace is made 'twixt man and God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, hail! enthroned in glory,
\par There for ever to abide;
\par All the heavenly host adore Thee;
\par Seated at Thy father's side:
\par There for sinners Thou art pleading,
\par There Thou dost our place prepare,
\par Ever for us interceding,
\par Till in glory we appear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Worship, honour, power, and blessing,
\par Thou art worthy to receive;
\par Loudest praises without ceasing,
\par Meet it is for us to give.
\par Help, ye bright, angelic  spirits!
\par Bring your sweetest, noblest lays;
\par Help to sing our Saviour's merits,
\par Help to chant Immanuel's praise!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

